#. あーあ、退屈…マジで退屈…
msgctxt "0001 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "God, I am seriously freaking bored...!"
msgstr ""

#. 死ぬ死ぬ…退屈過ぎて死ぬ…
msgctxt "0002 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "I'm gonna die... I'm gonna die from being so bored!"
msgstr ""

#. てゆーか死にかけてる。退屈過ぎて。
msgctxt "0003 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "I'm infected! I've got terminal boredom disease!"
msgstr ""

#. そ、そんなに…？
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I-Is it really that bad...?"
msgstr ""

#. 退屈なのって苦手なんだよね…
msgctxt "0005 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "I just hate being bored. Hate it!"
msgstr ""

#. …って、気付いたの最近だけど。
msgctxt "0006 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "I never noticed how much I hate it."
msgstr ""

#. 閉じ込められてから、
#. ようやく気付いたんだけど。
msgctxt "0007 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "But once we got trapped in here, it finally hit me!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だいぶ…最近だな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That's...pretty recent.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. つーか、こんな場所に閉じ込められてるくらいなら、
#. まだ野宿してる方がマシだっつーの…
msgctxt "0009 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid ""
"I'd rather be living homeless on the street than stuck\n"
"in here!"
msgstr ""

#. の、野宿…？
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Homeless...?"
msgstr ""

#. あぁ…<CLT 3>ホームレス生活<CLT>ってヤツ？
#. やってた事があるんだよね…
msgctxt "0011 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid ""
"Yeah, you know! Like, the <CLT 3>hobo life<CLT>! I've done it\n"
"before, ya know."
msgstr ""

#. やってたの！？
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You have!?"
msgstr ""

#. うん、色々あって…
msgctxt "0013 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "Yeah. It's...a long story."
msgstr ""

#. それが…今ではモデル？
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "And now you're a model!?"
msgstr ""

#. まぁ…それも色々あって…
msgctxt "0015 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "Well...that's a long story, too."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>色々…あり過ぎだろ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>How many \"long stories\" do you have...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …こんな場所に閉じ込められてるくらいなら、
#. あの頃の方がまだマシだよ。
msgctxt "0017 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid ""
"Seriously, if I had to choose between staying here and\n"
"being homeless again, gimme the street!"
msgstr ""

#. でも、そうかもしれないね…
#. 命の危険だって、今よりはないだろうし…
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I...guess I can understand that. I mean, you're\n"
"probably in more danger here than there..."
msgstr ""

#. いやいや！　野宿をなめてんじゃねーって！
#. いつ<CLT 3>敵<CLT>や<CLT 3>獣<CLT>に襲われるかわかったもんじゃないし！
msgctxt "0019 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid ""
"Oh, hell no! Homelessness is totally dangerous! You\n"
"never know when <CLT 3>a pack of wild animals<CLT> might show up."
msgstr ""

#. …敵？　獣？
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wild animals...?"
msgstr ""

#. …つまり、弱い者を狙ってる連中って事だよ。
msgctxt "0021 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid ""
"Oh, I don't mean literally. I mean people who attack\n"
"the weak, who want to hurt you."
msgstr ""

#. ほら、世間は敵や獣だらけでしょ？
msgctxt "0022 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "The world's full of animals like that, ya know?"
msgstr ""

#. まぁ、そういう過酷な環境に身を置いてたから、
#. あたしは強くなれたんだけど…
msgctxt "0023 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid ""
"But I think having to live like that made me way\n"
"stronger."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんか…妙に重みがあるな…
#. 実際、経験してた人が言うと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hearing someone with actual experience talk like that\n"
"really has a lot of weight to it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …ていうか、話が変な方に行っちゃったけど、
#. あたしが言いたいのは、そういう事じゃなくて…
msgctxt "0025 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid ""
"Sorry, that kinda got weird, huh? All I was trying to\n"
"say is..."
msgstr ""

#. いつになったら、
#. ここから出られるのかって事だよ！
msgctxt "0026 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "...when the hell are we gonna get out of here!?"
msgstr ""

#. おい、閉じ込めたヤツ！　聞いてんの！？
#. どうすりゃ、ここから出られんのさ！
msgctxt "0027 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid ""
"Hey, whatever dumb bastard trapped us in here, are you\n"
"listening!? When are you gonna let us OUT!?"
msgstr ""

#. いいから、出られる方法を教えなさいよ！
msgctxt "0028 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "Just tell us what we gotta do to get out of here!"
msgstr ""

#. 他の連中には内緒にしとくから、
#. あたしだけに、こっそり教えなさいよっ！
msgctxt "0029 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid ""
"Hell, you can even just tell me! I know how to keep a\n"
"secret!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>………………
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 返答なし…ムカツク…！
msgctxt "0031 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "Nothin', huh? Pisses me off..."
msgstr ""

#. そりゃ…簡単に教えてくれる訳ないよ…
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Well, I mean...there's no way they'd make it that\n"
"easy."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0033 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. でもさ、変な考えだけは起こしちゃ駄目だよ？
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But listen...you're not thinking of doing\n"
"anything...drastic, are you?"
msgstr ""

#. 変な…考え…？
msgctxt "0035 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "Drastic?"
msgstr ""

#. あぁ、誰かを殺せってヤツ？
msgctxt "0036 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "Oh, you mean the whole \"kill someone\" thing?"
msgstr ""

#. アハハ！　大丈夫だって！
#. あたしに人なんて殺せる訳ないじゃん！
msgctxt "0037 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "Haha! Don't worry, I could never kill someone!"
msgstr ""

#. えっ！？　あたしってそんな風に見えるの！？
#. 人を殺しそうに見えるの？
msgctxt "0038 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid ""
"What, do I look like I would? Do I seriously look like\n"
"a killer!?"
msgstr ""

#. いや、そういう風には…
#. 見えないけど…
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "N-No, that's not what I meant. Really, you don't..."
msgstr ""

#. でしょ？　そうでしょ？
msgctxt "0040 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "Right? I don't, right!?"
msgstr ""

#. てゆーか、苗木って心配してくれたの？
#. あたしの事…
msgctxt "0041 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "But anyway, are you saying you were worried about me?"
msgstr ""

#. ちょっとかわいかったかも…
#. あたしの心配する苗木…
msgctxt "0042 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "Gotta say, Makoto...that's kinda cute."
msgstr ""

#. 一瞬、キュン死にしそうになった…
msgctxt "0043 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "You almost killed me with cuteness there!"
msgstr ""

#. …へ？
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. アハハ！　冗談だって！
#. 本気にした！？
msgctxt "0045 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid ""
"C'mon, I'm just screwing with you! You didn't take it\n"
"serious, did you!?"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木って面白いね。
#. あんたと話してると飽きないよ。
msgctxt "0046 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid ""
"But ya know...there's something about you. I don't get\n"
"sick of talking to you, like I do most people."
msgstr ""

#. アハハ！　また遊ぼうねー！
msgctxt "0047 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "Let's hang out again sometime, 'kay? Ehehe!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>江ノ島さんは大げさに手を振りながら、
#. その場から去っていった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There was something playful about the way Junko walked\n"
"away.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. なんだか…よくわからないけど…
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I...still don't get her."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…ボクって遊ばれてる？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Am I getting played somehow...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>江ノ島盾子の<CLT><CLT 3>通信簿<CLT><CLT 23>に、今の情報を追記致しました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0051 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Junko's <CLT><CLT 3>Report Card<CLT><CLT 23> has been updated based on your\n"
"experience with her.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>おめでとうございます。
#. スキル<CLT><CLT 3>“トランス”<CLT><CLT 23>を獲得致しました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0052 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>You just unlocked the skill <CLT><CLT 3>Trance<CLT><CLT 23>!\n"
"Give yourself a pat on the back. You've earned it!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>江ノ島さんと別れた後、
#. ボクは自分の部屋へと戻っていった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0053 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>After parting ways with Junko, I went back to my room.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
